module.exports = {"key":"c21","slug":"ch16-rag","title":"第11章 RAG：检索增强生成","subtitle":"第三篇：Agent 的知识 — 让 Agent 拥有\"外挂知识库\"——从向量检索到生产级 RAG","html":"<h1 class=\"ct\">第11章 RAG：检索增强生成</h1>\n<p class=\"cs\">第三篇：Agent 的知识 — 让 Agent 拥有\"外挂知识库\"——从向量检索到生产级 RAG</p>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.1 为什么 Agent 需要 RAG？</h2>\n<p>大模型有两个硬伤：<strong>知识截止日期</strong>（训练数据有时效性）和<strong>领域知识不足</strong>（通用模型不懂你的业务）。微调可以解决一部分，但成本高、周期长、更新慢。<strong>RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation，检索增强生成）</strong>提供了更灵活的方案：<strong>先检索，再生成</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">💡 RAG 的核心思想</div><p>不是把知识\"塞进\"模型参数，而是在生成回答前，<strong>先从外部知识库检索相关文档</strong>，把检索到的内容作为上下文喂给 LLM。模型只需要\"阅读理解\"，不需要\"死记硬背\"。</p></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔴 纯 LLM（无 RAG）</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>知识截止到训练日期，不知道最新信息</li><li>企业内部文档一概不知</li><li>容易产生幻觉（编造事实）</li><li>无法引用信息来源</li><li>更新知识需要重新训练或微调</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🟢 LLM + RAG</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>知识实时更新，随时新增文档</li><li>接入企业内部知识库（Wiki/文档/工单）</li><li>基于检索到的真实内容回答，减少幻觉</li><li>可以引用来源文档，可追溯</li><li>无需重新训练，成本极低</li></ul></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">RAG vs 微调：什么时候用什么？</h3>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>对比维度</th>\n        <th>RAG</th>\n        <th>微调</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>知识更新</strong></td><td>实时，加文档即可</td><td>需要重新微调</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>适合场景</strong></td><td>事实性问答、文档检索</td><td>风格/格式/推理模式定制</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>成本</strong></td><td>低（向量数据库 + 检索）</td><td>高（GPU 训练）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>延迟</strong></td><td>多一次检索（+200-500ms）</td><td>无额外延迟</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>幻觉控制</strong></td><td>✅ 强（基于检索内容）</td><td>⚠️ 弱（仍可能编造）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>最佳实践</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>RAG + 微调结合</strong>：微调改善风格，RAG 提供知识</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.2 RAG 的完整流程</h2>\n<p>RAG 不是简单的\"搜索 + 拼接\"，一个生产级 RAG 系统包含<strong>五个阶段</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">1. 文档处理<br>加载/分块/清洗</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">2. 向量化<br>Embedding 编码</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">3. 存储<br>向量数据库</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">4. 检索<br>相似度搜索</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">5. 生成<br>LLM 回答</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">阶段一：文档处理（Chunking）</h3>\n<p>文档不能整篇丢给模型——上下文窗口有限，检索精度也不够。需要将长文档<strong>分块（Chunking）</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain.text_splitter <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 递归字符分割器：按优先级依次尝试分隔符</span>\nsplitter = <span class=\"tok-f\">RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter</span>(\n    chunk_size=<span class=\"tok-n\">512</span>,        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 每块最大 512 字符</span>\n    chunk_overlap=<span class=\"tok-n\">64</span>,      <span class=\"tok-c\"># 块间重叠 64 字符（保持上下文连贯）</span>\n    separators=[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n\\n\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"。\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"！\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"？\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"，\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\" \"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"</span>],\n    keep_separator=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>\n)\n\nchunks = splitter.<span class=\"tok-f\">split_text</span>(long_document)\n\n<span class=\"tok-f\">print</span>(f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"文档被分为 {len(chunks)} 块\"</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># chunk_size 太大 → 检索不精确、浪费 Token</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># chunk_size 太小 → 上下文断裂、语义不完整</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 经验值：512-1024 字符，overlap 10-15%</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-warning\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 分块策略选择</div><p><strong>固定大小分块</strong></p><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>简单快速，适合大多数场景</li><li>可能在句子中间截断</li></ul><p><strong>语义分块</strong></p><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>按段落/标题/语义边界分块</li><li>检索质量更高，但实现复杂</li></ul></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">阶段二：向量化（Embedding）</h3>\n<p>把文本块转成<strong>向量</strong>（高维浮点数组），使语义相近的文本在向量空间中距离也近。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">OpenAIEmbeddings</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 选择 Embedding 模型</span>\nembeddings = <span class=\"tok-f\">OpenAIEmbeddings</span>(model=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"text-embedding-3-small\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 单文本向量化</span>\nvector = embeddings.<span class=\"tok-f\">embed_query</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"什么是 RAG？\"</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 返回 1536 维浮点数组，如 [0.012, -0.034, 0.056, ...]</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 批量向量化（生产环境推荐批量操作）</span>\ntexts = [chunk <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> chunk <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> chunks]\nvectors = embeddings.<span class=\"tok-f\">embed_documents</span>(texts)</pre></div>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Embedding 模型</th>\n        <th>维度</th>\n        <th>特点</th>\n        <th>适合场景</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>text-embedding-3-small</strong></td><td>1536</td><td>OpenAI，性价比高</td><td>通用英文/中文</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>text-embedding-3-large</strong></td><td>3072</td><td>精度更高，成本翻倍</td><td>高精度检索</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>bge-large-zh-v1.5</strong></td><td>1024</td><td>开源，中文最强</td><td>中文场景/私有部署</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>jina-embeddings-v3</strong></td><td>1024</td><td>开源，多语言</td><td>多语言混合</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">阶段三：向量数据库存储</h3>\n<p>向量数据库专门存储和检索高维向量，支持<strong>近似最近邻搜索（ANN）</strong>，比暴力遍历快几个数量级。</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>向量数据库</th>\n        <th>类型</th>\n        <th>特点</th>\n        <th>适合场景</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>Chroma</strong></td><td>嵌入式</td><td>零配置，Python 原生</td><td>原型/小项目</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Pinecone</strong></td><td>云服务</td><td>全托管，弹性扩展</td><td>生产环境/无运维</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Weaviate</strong></td><td>自部署</td><td>GraphQL API，混合检索</td><td>企业自建</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Milvus</strong></td><td>自部署</td><td>亿级向量，分布式</td><td>大规模生产</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>pgvector</strong></td><td>PostgreSQL 插件</td><td>SQL 查询，事务支持</td><td>已有 PG 的项目</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> chromadb\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 创建客户端（数据持久化到磁盘）</span>\nclient = chromadb.<span class=\"tok-f\">PersistentClient</span>(path=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"./vector_db\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 创建集合（相当于数据库表）</span>\ncollection = client.<span class=\"tok-f\">get_or_create_collection</span>(\n    name=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"knowledge_base\"</span>,\n    metadata={<span class=\"tok-s\">\"hnsw:space\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"cosine\"</span>}  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 使用余弦相似度</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 写入向量</span>\ncollection.<span class=\"tok-f\">add</span>(\n    documents=chunks,                    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 原始文本</span>\n    embeddings=vectors,                  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 向量</span>\n    metadatas=[{<span class=\"tok-s\">\"source\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"doc1\"</span>} <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> _ <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> chunks],  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 元数据</span>\n    ids=[f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"chunk_{i}\"</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> i <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">range</span>(<span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(chunks))]   <span class=\"tok-c\"># 唯一 ID</span>\n)</pre></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.3 检索策略：不只是相似度搜索</h2>\n<p>最简单的 RAG 只做<strong>向量相似度搜索</strong>，但生产级 RAG 需要更复杂的检索策略。</p>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.3.1 基础：向量相似度搜索</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-c\"># 用户问题 → 向量 → 搜索最相似的文档块</span>\nquery = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"Agent 的记忆系统有哪些类型？\"</span>\nquery_vector = embeddings.<span class=\"tok-f\">embed_query</span>(query)\n\nresults = collection.<span class=\"tok-f\">query</span>(\n    query_embeddings=[query_vector],\n    n_results=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>,              <span class=\"tok-c\"># 返回 Top-5 最相似</span>\n    include=[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"documents\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"distances\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"metadatas\"</span>]\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># results['documents'][0] → [\"记忆分为短期记忆和长期记忆...\", ...]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># results['distances'][0] → [0.12, 0.34, 0.45, ...] 越小越相似</span></pre></div>\n<p><strong>三种相似度度量</strong>：</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>度量</th>\n        <th>公式</th>\n        <th>特点</th>\n        <th>适合</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>余弦相似度</strong></td><td>cos(A,B) = A·B / (|A||B|)</td><td>只看方向，不看大小</td><td>文本检索（最常用）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>欧氏距离</strong></td><td>d = √Σ(Ai-Bi)²</td><td>看绝对距离</td><td>图像检索</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>内积</strong></td><td>IP = A·B</td><td>考虑向量大小</td><td>归一化后的向量</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.3.2 进阶：混合检索（BM25 + 向量）</h3>\n<p>纯向量检索的弱点：<strong>关键词匹配能力差</strong>。比如搜\"GPT-4o\"，向量检索可能返回\"GPT-4\"的内容（语义相似但不是同一个模型）。<strong>BM25</strong>（关键词检索）正好互补。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain.retrievers <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">EnsembleRetriever</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain_community.retrievers <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">BM25Retriever</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain_community.vectorstores <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Chroma</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 1. 向量检索器（语义匹配）</span>\nvector_retriever = <span class=\"tok-f\">Chroma</span>(\n    collection_name=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"knowledge_base\"</span>,\n    embedding_function=embeddings\n).<span class=\"tok-f\">as_retriever</span>(search_kwargs={<span class=\"tok-s\">\"k\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>})\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 2. BM25 检索器（关键词匹配）</span>\nbm25_retriever = <span class=\"tok-t\">BM25Retriever</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">from_documents</span>(chunks)\nbm25_retriever.k = <span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 3. 混合检索器（加权融合）</span>\nensemble_retriever = <span class=\"tok-f\">EnsembleRetriever</span>(\n    retrievers=[bm25_retriever, vector_retriever],\n    weights=[<span class=\"tok-n\">0.4</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0.6</span>]  <span class=\"tok-c\"># BM25 占 40%，向量占 60%</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 混合检索效果最好：语义匹配 + 关键词精准匹配</span>\ndocs = ensemble_retriever.<span class=\"tok-f\">get_relevant_documents</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"GPT-4o 的多模态能力\"</span>)</pre></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.3.3 进阶：重排序（Reranker）</h3>\n<p>向量检索速度快但精度有限，返回 Top-20 中可能有噪声。<strong>重排序模型</strong>对这 20 条结果做精细打分，选出最相关的 Top-5。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-info\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📊 两阶段检索：快召回 + 精排序</div><ol class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>召回阶段</strong>：向量检索快速从百万文档中召回 Top-50（毫秒级）</li><li><strong>重排阶段</strong>：Cross-Encoder 模型对 50 条逐一精细打分，选 Top-5（百毫秒级）</li></ol><p>Cross-Encoder 比 Bi-Encoder（向量检索）精度高，但速度慢 100 倍，所以只用在小规模候选集上。</p></div>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain.retrievers <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ContextualCompressionRetriever</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain_cohere <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">CohereRerank</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 重排序模型</span>\nreranker = <span class=\"tok-f\">CohereRerank</span>(top_n=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>)  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 从候选集中选 Top-5</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 压缩检索器：先向量检索召回 → 再重排序</span>\ncompression_retriever = <span class=\"tok-f\">ContextualCompressionRetriever</span>(\n    base_compressor=reranker,\n    base_retriever=vector_retriever  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 先召回 Top-20</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 最终结果：精度远超纯向量检索</span>\ndocs = compression_retriever.<span class=\"tok-f\">get_relevant_documents</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"Agent 如何管理长期记忆？\"</span>)</pre></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.4 RAG 高级优化技巧</h2>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.4.1 Query 改写</h3>\n<p>用户提问往往模糊或口语化，直接检索效果差。先用 LLM <strong>改写 Query</strong>，提升检索质量。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">ChatOpenAI</span>\n\nllm = <span class=\"tok-f\">ChatOpenAI</span>(model=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 改写策略</span>\nrewrite_prompt = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"你是一个搜索查询优化器。将用户的口语化问题改写为更适合检索的查询。\n\n用户问题：{question}\n\n改写要求：\n1. 提取核心关键词\n2. 补充可能的同义词\n3. 生成 3 个不同角度的查询\n\n输出格式：JSON 数组，如 [\"query1\", \"query2\", \"query3\"]\n\"\"\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 原始问题：\"Agent 怎么记住东西的？\"</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 改写后：[\"Agent 记忆系统架构\", \"Agent 短期记忆 长期记忆\", \"LLM memory management\"]</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 多查询并行检索，结果合并去重 → 召回率大幅提升</span></pre></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.4.2 HyDE（假设性文档嵌入）</h3>\n<p>有时候用户的问题太短，向量化后语义信息不足。<strong>HyDE</strong> 的思路是：先让 LLM 生成一个\"假回答\"，用假回答去检索，再用检索结果生成真回答。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔄 HyDE 流程</div><p><strong>用户问题</strong>：\"RAG 怎么做？\" →<br>\n    <strong>LLM 生成假回答</strong>：\"RAG 是检索增强生成技术，通过先检索相关文档再生成回答……\" →<br>\n    <strong>用假回答向量检索</strong>（假回答比短问题语义更丰富）→<br>\n    <strong>用检索结果生成真回答</strong></p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.4.3 父子分块（Parent-Child Chunking）</h3>\n<p>检索时用<strong>小块</strong>（精确匹配），生成时用<strong>大块</strong>（上下文完整）。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">策略说明</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-c\"># 大块（Parent Chunk）：512 字符 → 存储、生成时使用</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 小块（Child Chunk）：128 字符 → 检索时使用</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 流程：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 1. 文档先分成 512 字符的大块</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 2. 每个大块再细分为 128 字符的小块</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 3. 小块做 Embedding 并存储，但保留 parent_id</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 4. 检索时匹配小块 → 找到对应的大块 → 用大块作为上下文</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 优势：检索精度高（小块精确），上下文完整（大块信息丰富）</span></pre></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.5 Agent + RAG：让 Agent 自主决定何时检索</h2>\n<p>最简单的 RAG 是\"每次提问都检索\"，但有些问题不需要检索（如\"你好\"、\"1+1=?\"）。把 RAG 包装成 Agent 的一个<strong>工具</strong>，让 Agent 自主决定何时检索。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain.tools <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Tool</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langchain.agents <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> create_react_agent, <span class=\"tok-t\">AgentExecutor</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">rag_search</span>(query: str) -&gt; str:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"检索知识库并返回相关文档\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 1. Query 改写</span>\n    rewritten = llm.<span class=\"tok-f\">invoke</span>(rewrite_prompt.<span class=\"tok-f\">format</span>(question=query))\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 2. 多查询并行检索</span>\n    all_docs = []\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> q <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">parse_queries</span>(rewritten):\n        docs = ensemble_retriever.<span class=\"tok-f\">get_relevant_documents</span>(q)\n        all_docs.<span class=\"tok-f\">extend</span>(docs)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 3. 去重 + 重排序</span>\n    unique_docs = <span class=\"tok-f\">deduplicate</span>(all_docs)\n    ranked_docs = reranker.<span class=\"tok-f\">compress_documents</span>(unique_docs, query)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 4. 返回拼接的上下文</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n\\n\"</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>([doc.page_content <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> doc <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> ranked_docs[:<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>]])\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 将 RAG 注册为 Agent 工具</span>\ntools = [\n    <span class=\"tok-f\">Tool</span>(\n        name=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"knowledge_search\"</span>,\n        description=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"搜索内部知识库，获取产品文档、技术文档、FAQ等信息。当需要查找具体信息时使用。\"</span>,\n        func=rag_search\n    ),\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># ... 其他工具</span>\n]\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># Agent 自主决定何时检索</span>\nagent = <span class=\"tok-f\">create_react_agent</span>(llm, tools, prompt)\nexecutor = <span class=\"tok-f\">AgentExecutor</span>(agent=agent, tools=tools, verbose=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 用户：\"你好\" → Agent 不检索，直接回答</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 用户：\"我们的 API 限流策略是什么？\" → Agent 调用 knowledge_search</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-success\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">✅ Agent + RAG 的优势</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>智能路由</strong>：简单问题不检索，省 Token、降延迟</li><li><strong>多轮检索</strong>：复杂问题可以多次检索不同关键词</li><li><strong>结果验证</strong>：Agent 可以判断检索结果是否相关，不相关则换关键词重搜</li><li><strong>引用来源</strong>：Agent 可以在回答中标注\"根据 [文档名] ...\"</li></ul></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.6 生产级 RAG 架构</h2>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🏭 企业级 RAG 系统架构</div><p><strong>数据接入层</strong></p><p>文档加载器（PDF/Word/HTML/Confluence）→ 文档清洗 → 元数据提取</p><p><strong>索引层</strong></p><p>分块 → 向量化 → 写入向量数据库（增量更新、版本管理）</p><p><strong>检索层</strong></p><p>Query 改写 → 混合检索（BM25 + 向量）→ 重排序 → 上下文组装</p><p><strong>生成层</strong></p><p>Prompt 模板 → LLM 生成 → 回答后处理（去幻觉、加引用）</p><p><strong>评估层</strong></p><p>检索准确率、回答忠实度、用户反馈 → 持续优化</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.7 GraphRAG：知识图谱增强检索</h2>\n<p>传统向量 RAG 有一个致命弱点：<strong>只能检索局部相似片段，无法回答全局性问题</strong>。比如\"整个系统架构包含哪些模块？\"这样的问题需要跨文档、跨段落的全局视角。<strong>GraphRAG</strong> 通过构建知识图谱，让 RAG 具备\"关联推理\"的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">💡 GraphRAG 的核心思想</div><p>不只是把文档切成块存向量库，而是先从文档中<strong>抽取实体和关系</strong>，构建一张知识图谱。检索时不是做向量相似度搜索，而是在图上进行<strong>子图检索和图遍历</strong>，找到与问题相关的实体及其关联信息。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.7.1 GraphRAG 的四步流程</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">1. 实体抽取<br>LLM 识别实体</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">2. 关系构建<br>实体间连边</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">3. 子图检索<br>定位相关子图</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">4. 图遍历生成<br>沿边扩展上下文</div></div>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> llama_index.core <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">KnowledgeGraphIndex</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> llama_index.core.graph_stores <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">SimpleGraphStore</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> llama_index.llms.openai <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">OpenAI</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 1. 实体抽取 + 关系构建（LLM 自动完成）</span>\nllm = <span class=\"tok-f\">OpenAI</span>(model=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># KnowledgeGraphIndex 自动从文档中抽取实体和关系</span>\nkg_index = <span class=\"tok-t\">KnowledgeGraphIndex</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">from_documents</span>(\n    documents,\n    llm=llm,\n    max_triplets_per_chunk=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>,  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 每个块最多抽取 5 个三元组</span>\n    include_embeddings=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>     <span class=\"tok-c\"># 同时生成实体嵌入</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 抽取的三元组示例：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># (\"RAG\", \"属于\", \"检索增强生成技术\")</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># (\"向量数据库\", \"用于\", \"RAG\")</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># (\"Agent\", \"调用\", \"RAG\")</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 2. 子图检索：从问题实体出发，沿关系边遍历</span>\nquery_engine = kg_index.<span class=\"tok-f\">as_query_engine</span>(\n    include_text=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>,     <span class=\"tok-c\"># 同时返回原文片段</span>\n    similarity_top_k=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>,    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 返回 Top-5 相关子图</span>\n    graph_depth=<span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>          <span class=\"tok-c\"># 图遍历深度 2 跳</span>\n)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 3. 生成回答时，上下文 = 子图结构 + 原文片段</span>\nresponse = query_engine.<span class=\"tok-f\">query</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"Agent 和 RAG 是什么关系？\"</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># → 沿 \"Agent\" → \"调用\" → \"RAG\" → \"属于\" → \"检索增强生成技术\" 遍历</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># → 上下文包含完整关系链，而非孤立的文本块</span></pre></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.7.2 GraphRAG vs 向量 RAG：什么时候用什么？</h3>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>对比维度</th>\n        <th>向量 RAG</th>\n        <th>GraphRAG</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>检索方式</strong></td><td>语义相似度搜索</td><td>实体关系图遍历</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>擅长问题</strong></td><td>事实性问答（\"X 是什么？\"）</td><td>关联性问答（\"X 和 Y 什么关系？\"）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>全局视角</strong></td><td>❌ 只看局部相似片段</td><td>✅ 跨文档关联推理</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>多跳推理</strong></td><td>❌ 最多 1 跳（检索到的片段）</td><td>✅ 多跳图遍历（A→B→C→D）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>构建成本</strong></td><td>低（分块 + Embedding）</td><td>高（LLM 抽取实体关系）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>更新成本</strong></td><td>低（增量加向量）</td><td>中（需更新图谱边）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>延迟</strong></td><td>毫秒级</td><td>百毫秒~秒级</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>最佳实践</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\"><strong>混合使用</strong>：向量 RAG 做日常问答，GraphRAG 做复杂关联分析</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-warning\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ GraphRAG 的代价</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>构建成本高</strong>：需要用 LLM 从每篇文档中抽取实体和关系，Token 消耗大</li><li><strong>维护复杂</strong>：文档更新时需要同步更新图谱结构，比加向量复杂得多</li><li><strong>实体歧义</strong>：\"苹果\"是公司还是水果？需要实体消歧（Entity Disambiguation）</li><li><strong>不适合简单问答</strong>：杀鸡用牛刀，\"RAG 是什么\"用向量检索就够了</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-success\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">✅ GraphRAG 的黄金场景</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>多跳推理问答</strong>：\"A 公司的 CEO 毕业于哪所大学？\" → 需要跨文档追溯</li><li><strong>关系分析</strong>：\"这个故障影响了哪些下游服务？\" → 微服务依赖图</li><li><strong>全局摘要</strong>：\"整个系统架构包含哪些模块？\" → 需要全局视角</li><li><strong>因果追溯</strong>：\"为什么这个指标下降了？\" → 因果链路遍历</li></ul></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.8 Agentic RAG：Agent 驱动的自适应检索</h2>\n<p>传统 RAG 是一个<strong>固定流水线</strong>：用户提问 → 检索 → 拼接上下文 → LLM 生成。无论问题难易，流程都一样。但这不合理——有些问题不需要检索，有些需要检索多次，有些需要先检索再反思再检索。<strong>Agentic RAG</strong> 把 Agent 引入检索循环，让 Agent 动态决策<strong>是否检索、检索几次、何时停止</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">💡 Agentic RAG 的核心思想</div><p>不再是一条固定的\"检索→生成\"流水线，而是让 Agent 作为<strong>检索编排者</strong>，根据问题难度动态决定检索策略：简单问题直接回答，复杂问题多轮检索+反思，检索不充分则换角度重搜，直到信息充分才生成最终回答。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.8.1 传统 RAG vs Agentic RAG</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔴 传统 RAG Pipeline</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>固定流程：Query → Retrieve → Generate</li><li>每次提问都检索，不管是否需要</li><li>只检索一次，不管结果够不够</li><li>检索结果直接拼接，不做质量判断</li><li>无法根据结果调整检索策略</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🟢 Agentic RAG</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li>动态流程：Agent 自主决策每一步</li><li>判断是否需要检索（简单问题跳过）</li><li>支持多轮检索，直到信息充分</li><li>每次检索后反思：结果是否相关？</li><li>可以改写 Query 换角度重新检索</li></ul></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.8.2 Agentic RAG 的核心循环</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">用户提问</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">Agent 判断<br>需要检索吗?</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">不需要</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">生成回答 + 引用来源</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">执行检索<br>Query 改写 + 混合检索 + 重排序</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision mp-flow-branch\">反思: 信息充分吗?</div></div>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> langgraph.graph <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">StateGraph</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">END</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> typing <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">TypedDict</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">List</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">RAGState</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">TypedDict</span>):\n    question: str\n    retrieved_docs: <span class=\"tok-t\">List</span>[str]\n    answer: str\n    reflection: str       <span class=\"tok-c\"># 反思结果</span>\n    search_count: int     <span class=\"tok-c\"># 检索次数</span>\n    sufficient: bool      <span class=\"tok-c\"># 信息是否充分</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">decide_to_search</span>(state: <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>) -&gt; str:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"Agent 决策：是否需要检索\"\"\"</span>\n    question = state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"question\"</span>]\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 简单问题不检索（如打招呼、算术题）</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">is_simple_question</span>(question):\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate_direct\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 已有文档是否充分？</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> state.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"sufficient\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">False</span>):\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 最多检索 3 轮，防止死循环</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> state.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search_count\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>) &gt;= <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">search</span>(state: <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"执行检索：Query 改写 + 混合检索 + 重排序\"\"\"</span>\n    question = state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"question\"</span>]\n    count = state.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search_count\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 第 2 轮起，根据反思结果改写 Query</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> count &gt; <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>:\n        question = <span class=\"tok-f\">llm_rewrite_query</span>(question, state.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"reflection\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"</span>))\n    \n    docs = <span class=\"tok-f\">hybrid_search</span>(question, top_k=<span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>)\n    ranked_docs = reranker.<span class=\"tok-f\">rerank</span>(docs, question, top_n=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>)\n    \n    state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"retrieved_docs\"</span>] = state.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"retrieved_docs\"</span>, []) + ranked_docs\n    state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search_count\"</span>] = count + <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> state\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">reflect</span>(state: <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"反思：检索结果是否足以回答问题？\"\"\"</span>\n    prompt = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"问题：{state['question']}\n已有文档：{state['retrieved_docs']}\n判断：当前文档是否足以完整回答问题？\n如果不足，指出缺少什么信息。\"\"\"</span>\n    result = llm.<span class=\"tok-f\">invoke</span>(prompt)\n    state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"reflection\"</span>] = result\n    state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"sufficient\"</span>] = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"信息充分\"</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> result\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> state\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">generate</span>(state: <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"生成最终回答\"\"\"</span>\n    context = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n\\n\"</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>(state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"retrieved_docs\"</span>])\n    state[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"answer\"</span>] = llm.<span class=\"tok-f\">invoke</span>(f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"基于以下信息回答问题：\\n{context}\\n\\n问题：{state['question']}\"</span>)\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> state\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 构建工作流图</span>\nworkflow = <span class=\"tok-f\">StateGraph</span>(<span class=\"tok-t\">RAGState</span>)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_node</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"decide\"</span>, decide_to_search)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_node</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>, search)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_node</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"reflect\"</span>, reflect)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_node</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>, generate)\n\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">set_entry_point</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"decide\"</span>)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_conditional_edges</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"decide\"</span>, decide_to_search, {\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate_direct\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>\n})\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_edge</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"reflect\"</span>)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_conditional_edges</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"reflect\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-k\">lambda</span> s: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">not</span> s[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"sufficient\"</span>] <span class=\"tok-k\">and</span> s[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"search_count\"</span>] &lt; <span class=\"tok-n\">3</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>)\nworkflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">add_edge</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"generate\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">END</span>)\n\nagent_rag = workflow.<span class=\"tok-f\">compile</span>()\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 用户：\"你好\" → decide 判断简单问题 → 直接生成</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 用户：\"我们系统的限流策略和降级策略分别是什么？\" →</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">#   第1轮检索限流策略 → 反思：缺少降级策略 →</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\">#   第2轮检索降级策略 → 反思：信息充分 → 生成完整回答</span></pre></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.8.3 Agentic RAG 什么时候触发检索？</h3>\n<p>这是面试高频追问点。Agent 通过以下信号判断是否触发检索：</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>触发信号</th>\n        <th>说明</th>\n        <th>示例</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>问题类型判断</strong></td><td>事实性问题 → 检索；闲聊/算术 → 跳过</td><td>\"今天天气\" → 检索；\"1+1\" → 跳过</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>知识边界检测</strong></td><td>问题涉及模型训练截止后的信息 → 检索</td><td>\"2025年新发布模型\" → 检索</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>领域关键词匹配</strong></td><td>问题包含企业专有名词 → 检索内部知识库</td><td>\"我们的SLA策略\" → 检索</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>反思触发再检索</strong></td><td>已有文档不足以回答 → 改写Query重搜</td><td>第1轮只有限流，缺降级 → 第2轮搜降级</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>用户显式要求</strong></td><td>用户要求查证或引用来源 → 检索</td><td>\"帮我查一下文档\" → 检索</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-info\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📊 Agentic RAG 的关键设计：防止死循环</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>最大检索次数限制</strong>：通常设 3 轮，超过则用已有信息生成（宁可答案不完美，也不能死循环）</li><li><strong>反思质量评估</strong>：反思模型判断信息充分性，避免无意义的重复检索</li><li><strong>Query 改写递进</strong>：每轮检索改写 Query，避免相同查询返回相同结果</li><li><strong>成本控制</strong>：每轮检索消耗 Token，Agent 需要在质量和成本间权衡</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔥 2026 面试视角：Agentic RAG vs 传统 RAG</div><p><strong>传统 RAG</strong>是\"流水线工人\"——固定流程，不管实际情况。<br>\n    <strong>Agentic RAG</strong>是\"调研员\"——先判断要不要查资料，查了一轮发现不够再查，查到够为止。<br><br>\n    <strong>核心区别</strong>：Agentic RAG 引入了<strong>决策环节（是否检索）</strong> + <strong>反思环节（够不够）</strong> + <strong>迭代能力（换角度重搜）</strong>，这是从\"工具\"升级为<strong>智能体</strong>的关键。</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.9 代码知识库：tree-sitter 符号感知分块</h2>\n<p>前面的章节讲的都是<strong>文本 RAG</strong>——把文档切成固定大小的块。但如果你要建一个<strong>代码知识库</strong>，比如把整个项目的源码放进去让 AI 回答\"<code>handle_messages 函数是干什么的</code>\"，固定大小分块会出大问题。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：函数被从中间截断</div><p>假设 <code>chunk_size=500</code>，一个 80 行的函数会被切成 2-3 个块。检索时可能只返回第 2 个块——没有函数签名、没有参数定义，AI 根本看不懂这段代码在做什么。<br><br>\n    <strong>更糟的是</strong>：块里可能混着两个半截函数，前半截是 <code>fn handle_messages</code> 的结尾，后半截是 <code>fn handle_connections</code> 的开头，语义完全混乱。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.9.1 tree-sitter 是什么？</h3>\n<p><strong>tree-sitter</strong> 是一个增量解析库，能将源码解析为 <strong>AST（抽象语法树）</strong>。它的核心能力是：给你一段代码，告诉你哪个字节范围是一个函数定义、哪个是类定义、哪个是方法。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔧 tree-sitter 的核心能力</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>增量解析</strong>：代码修改时只重新解析变化的部分，适合编辑器实时场景</li><li><strong>多语言支持</strong>：支持 TS/TSX/JS/Python/Rust/Go/Java 等 40+ 语言</li><li><strong>AST 节点类型</strong>：function_declaration、class_declaration、method_definition 等，精确到符号级别</li><li><strong>错误恢复</strong>：代码有语法错误也能解析出有效部分，不会直接崩溃</li></ul></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.9.2 符号感知分块</h3>\n<p>核心思路：<strong>不按字符切，按 AST 符号边界切</strong>。每个 chunk 是一个完整的符号（函数/类/方法/结构体/接口/枚举），并附带元数据：</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>元数据字段</th>\n        <th>说明</th>\n        <th>示例</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><code>symbol_name</code></td><td>符号名称</td><td><code>handle_messages</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>symbol_kind</code></td><td>符号类型</td><td><code>function</code> / <code>class</code> / <code>method</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>line_start</code></td><td>起始行号</td><td><code>42</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>line_end</code></td><td>结束行号</td><td><code>120</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>signature</code></td><td>函数签名</td><td><code>fn handle_messages(msg: Message) -&gt; Result</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>docstring</code></td><td>文档注释</td><td><code>/// Process incoming messages and route to handlers</code></td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><p>固定大小分块</p><div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><pre class=\"code\">chunk <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>: [fn <span class=\"tok-f\">handle_messages</span>() {\n    let msg = <span class=\"tok-f\">receive</span>();\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> msg.type == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_text</span>(msg);\n    } <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> msg.type == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"image\"</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_image</span>(msg);\n    }\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// --- 截断 ---</span>\n\nchunk <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>: <span class=\"tok-c\">// 接上</span>\n    } <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_unknown</span>(msg);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(msg);\n}\n\nfn <span class=\"tok-f\">handle_connections</span>() {\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// --- 截断 ---</span></pre></div><p>❌ 函数被截断，检索到 chunk 2 完全看不懂</p></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><p>符号感知分块</p><div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><pre class=\"code\">chunk <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>: [fn <span class=\"tok-f\">handle_messages</span>() {\n    let msg = <span class=\"tok-f\">receive</span>();\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> msg.type == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_text</span>(msg);\n    } <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> msg.type == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"image\"</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_image</span>(msg);\n    } <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-f\">route_unknown</span>(msg);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(msg);\n}]\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// 完整函数，元数据: symbol_name=handle_messages, kind=function</span>\n\nchunk <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>: [fn <span class=\"tok-f\">handle_connections</span>() { ... }]\n<span class=\"tok-c\">// 完整函数，元数据: symbol_name=handle_connections, kind=function</span></pre></div><p>✅ 每个函数完整保留，可按符号类型过滤检索</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.9.3 代码实现：提取符号边界</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">from</span> tree_sitter <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">Parser</span>, <span class=\"tok-t\">Language</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 加载语言（需要预编译 .so 文件）</span>\nlang = <span class=\"tok-f\">Language</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"build/my-languages.so\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"python\"</span>)\nparser = <span class=\"tok-f\">Parser</span>()\nparser.<span class=\"tok-f\">set_language</span>(lang)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 符号类型映射：不同语言的 AST 节点名称不同</span>\n<span class=\"tok-t\">SYMBOL_KINDS</span> = {\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">'python'</span>: {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'function_definition'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'function'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'class_definition'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'class'</span>,\n    },\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">'rust'</span>: {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'function_item'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'function'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'struct_item'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'struct'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'enum_item'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'enum'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'impl_item'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'impl'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'trait_item'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'trait'</span>,\n    },\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">'typescript'</span>: {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'function_declaration'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'function'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'class_declaration'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'class'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'method_definition'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'method'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'interface_declaration'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'interface'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">'enum_declaration'</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">'enum'</span>,\n    },\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 提取符号边界的核心函数</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">extract_symbols</span>(source_code: str, language: str) -&gt; list:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"从源码中提取所有顶层符号（函数/类/方法等）\n    返回: [{symbol_name, symbol_kind, line_start, line_end, signature, content}, ...]\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    tree = parser.<span class=\"tok-f\">parse</span>(source_code.<span class=\"tok-f\">encode</span>())\n    symbols = []\n    kinds = <span class=\"tok-t\">SYMBOL_KINDS</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(language, {})\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">walk</span>(node):\n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 匹配符号类型</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> node.type <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> kinds:\n            symbol = {\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_name'</span>: <span class=\"tok-f\">get_symbol_name</span>(node, source_code),\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_kind'</span>: kinds[node.type],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'line_start'</span>: node.start_point[<span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'line_end'</span>: node.end_point[<span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'content'</span>: source_code[node.start_byte:node.end_byte],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'signature'</span>: <span class=\"tok-f\">get_signature</span>(node, source_code),\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'docstring'</span>: <span class=\"tok-f\">get_docstring</span>(node, source_code),\n            }\n            symbols.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>(symbol)\n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 递归子节点</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> child <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> node.children:\n            <span class=\"tok-f\">walk</span>(child)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-f\">walk</span>(tree.root_node)\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> symbols\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 分块：每个符号一个 chunk</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">split_code_by_symbols</span>(source_code: str, language: str) -&gt; list:\n    symbols = <span class=\"tok-f\">extract_symbols</span>(source_code, language)\n    chunks = []\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> sym <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> symbols:\n        chunks.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>({\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">'content'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'content'</span>],\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">'metadata'</span>: {\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_name'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_name'</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_kind'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'symbol_kind'</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'line_start'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'line_start'</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'line_end'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'line_end'</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'signature'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'signature'</span>],\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'docstring'</span>: sym[<span class=\"tok-s\">'docstring'</span>],\n            }\n        })\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> chunks\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 使用示例</span>\nsource = <span class=\"tok-f\">open</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"handler.py\"</span>).<span class=\"tok-f\">read</span>()\nchunks = <span class=\"tok-f\">split_code_by_symbols</span>(source, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"python\"</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> chunk <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> chunks:\n    <span class=\"tok-f\">print</span>(f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"{chunk['metadata']['symbol_kind']}: {chunk['metadata']['symbol_name']} \"</span>\n          f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"(L{chunk['metadata']['line_start']}-{chunk['metadata']['line_end']})\"</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 输出:</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># function: handle_messages (L42-L120)</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># class: MessageRouter (L122-L200)</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># function: route_text (L202-L215)</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-info\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔍 符号过滤检索</div><p>分块时带了 <code>symbol_kind</code> 元数据，检索时就能做<strong>符号过滤</strong>：<br>\n    用户搜 \"<code>handle_messages 函数</code>\"，先 <code>hybrid_search</code> 得到结果，再 <code>filter_by_symbol(results, \"function\")</code> 只返回函数定义，过滤掉注释、import、变量声明等噪声。<br><br>\n    这是代码 RAG 和文本 RAG 的核心区别——<strong>分块策略</strong>决定检索质量，<strong>检索过滤</strong>决定结果精度。</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.10 HNSW 索引：让向量搜索从 O(n) 到 O(log n)</h2>\n<p>上一节讲了向量检索，但有一个问题被跳过了：<strong>10 万个向量，怎么搜索？</strong></p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：线性扫描的代价</div><p>最简单的做法：<strong>遍历所有向量，逐一计算余弦相似度，取 Top-K</strong>。10 万个向量就要算 10 万次余弦距离。每次计算涉及 1536 维浮点数（OpenAI text-embedding-3-small），单次搜索可能需要数百毫秒。<br><br>\n    这在生产环境完全不可接受。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.10.1 HNSW 原理：分层小世界图</h3>\n<p><strong>HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World）</strong> 是目前最流行的近似最近邻搜索（ANN）算法。核心思想：<strong>构建多层图结构，上层稀疏（高速公路），下层稠密（城市道路），搜索时从上层快速定位区域，再在下层精细搜索</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">Layer 2 (稀疏)<br>高速公路: 快速定位区域</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">贪心搜索到本层最近</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">Layer 1 (中等)<br>省道: 缩小范围</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">下降一层</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">Layer 0 (稠密)<br>城市道路: 精细搜索</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">优先级队列维护候选</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">返回 Top-K<br>相似度最高的 K 个向量</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.10.2 搜索过程</h3>\n<p>HNSW 搜索使用<strong>贪心最佳优先搜索 + 优先级队列</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📊 HNSW 搜索算法步骤</div><ol class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>从顶层入口节点开始</strong>，计算当前节点与查询向量的距离</li><li><strong>贪心搜索</strong>：检查邻居节点，如果有比当前更近的，移动过去</li><li><strong>本层没有更近的了</strong>：下降到下一层，以上层结果为入口</li><li><strong>到底层（Layer 0）</strong>：精细搜索，用优先级队列维护 Top-K 候选</li><li><strong>返回 Top-K</strong>：优先级队列中相似度最高的 K 个向量</li></ol></div>\n<p><strong>余弦距离</strong>公式：<code>distance = 1 - cosine_similarity</code>。距离越小越相似。</p>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.10.3 纯手写 vs 外部向量数据库</h3>\n<p>大多数 RAG 教程直接用 Chroma/Pinecone/Milvus，但生产中很多场景不想引入新依赖。WaLiAPI 的做法是<strong>纯 Rust 手写 HNSW</strong>，用 <code>bincode</code> 序列化到本地文件，零外部依赖。</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>方案</th>\n        <th>搜索复杂度</th>\n        <th>构建时间</th>\n        <th>内存占用</th>\n        <th>适合规模</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>线性扫描</strong></td><td>O(n)</td><td>无需构建</td><td>仅向量数据</td><td>&lt;1万</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>HNSW（手写）</strong></td><td>O(log n)</td><td>中等</td><td>向量 + 图结构</td><td>1万-100万</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>IVF（聚类）</strong></td><td>O(n/cluster)</td><td>需训练</td><td>向量 + 倒排</td><td>100万-1亿</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>Milvus/Qdrant</strong></td><td>O(log n)</td><td>自动</td><td>完整服务</td><td>1亿+</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.10.4 代码实现：HNSW 搜索核心</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> heapq\n<span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"tok-k\">as</span> np\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">HnswIndex</span>:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"简化版 HNSW 索引\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">__init__</span>(self, dim: int, max_layers: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">16</span>):\n        self.dim = dim\n        self.max_layers = max_layers\n        self.nodes = []          <span class=\"tok-c\"># 所有向量</span>\n        self.graphs = []         <span class=\"tok-c\"># 每层的图结构 {node_id: [neighbor_ids]}</span>\n        self.entry_point = <span class=\"tok-k\">None</span>  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 入口节点</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>(self, vector: list):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"插入一个向量，构建多层图\"\"\"</span>\n        node_id = <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(self.nodes)\n        self.nodes.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>(np.<span class=\"tok-f\">array</span>(vector))\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 随机选择最高层（指数分布，越高层概率越低）</span>\n        level = <span class=\"tok-f\">int</span>(-np.<span class=\"tok-f\">log</span>(np.random.<span class=\"tok-f\">random</span>()) * <span class=\"tok-n\">1.5</span>)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 从顶层到 level 层，每层都插入节点</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> layer <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">range</span>(<span class=\"tok-f\">min</span>(level + <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, self.max_layers)):\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> layer &gt;= <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(self.graphs):\n                self.graphs.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>({})\n            self.graphs[layer][node_id] = []\n            \n            <span class=\"tok-c\"># 连接到同层的近邻节点</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(self.nodes) &gt; <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>:\n                neighbors = self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_search_layer</span>(vector, layer, ef=<span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>)\n                self.graphs[layer][node_id] = neighbors[:<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>]\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> self.entry_point <span class=\"tok-k\">is</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">None</span>:\n            self.entry_point = node_id\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">search</span>(self, query: list, top_k: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>) -&gt; list:\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"搜索 Top-K 最相似向量\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> self.entry_point <span class=\"tok-k\">is</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">None</span>:\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> []\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 从顶层贪心搜索到底层</span>\n        current = self.entry_point\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> layer <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">range</span>(<span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(self.graphs) - <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>, -<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>):\n            current = self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_greedy_search</span>(query, current, layer)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 底层精细搜索</span>\n        candidates = self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_search_layer</span>(query, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>, ef=top_k * <span class=\"tok-n\">4</span>)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 按距离排序返回 Top-K</span>\n        distances = [(node_id, self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(query, self.nodes[node_id]))\n                     <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> node_id <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> candidates]\n        distances.<span class=\"tok-f\">sort</span>(key=<span class=\"tok-k\">lambda</span> x: x[<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>])\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> distances[:top_k]\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">_greedy_search</span>(self, query, entry, layer):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"贪心搜索：不断移动到更近的邻居\"\"\"</span>\n        current = entry\n        current_dist = self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(query, self.nodes[current])\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">while</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>:\n            improved = <span class=\"tok-k\">False</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> neighbor <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> self.graphs[layer].<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(current, []):\n                dist = self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(query, self.nodes[neighbor])\n                <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> dist &lt; current_dist:\n                    current = neighbor\n                    current_dist = dist\n                    improved = <span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">not</span> improved:\n                <span class=\"tok-k\">break</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> current\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">_search_layer</span>(self, query, layer, ef=<span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"在某层搜索 ef 个候选\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">not</span> self.graphs[layer]:\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> []\n        visited = <span class=\"tok-f\">set</span>()\n        candidates = []\n        entry = self.entry_point <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> layer == <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(self.graphs) - <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>\n        heapq.<span class=\"tok-f\">heappush</span>(candidates, (self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(query, self.nodes[entry]), entry))\n        visited.<span class=\"tok-f\">add</span>(entry)\n        results = []\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">while</span> candidates:\n            dist, node = heapq.<span class=\"tok-f\">heappop</span>(candidates)\n            results.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>(node)\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(results) &gt;= ef:\n                <span class=\"tok-k\">break</span>\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> neighbor <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> self.graphs[layer].<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(node, []):\n                <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> neighbor <span class=\"tok-k\">not</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> visited:\n                    visited.<span class=\"tok-f\">add</span>(neighbor)\n                    heapq.<span class=\"tok-f\">heappush</span>(candidates,\n                        (self.<span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(query, self.nodes[neighbor]), neighbor))\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> results\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">_distance</span>(self, a, b):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"余弦距离 = 1 - 余弦相似度\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> - np.<span class=\"tok-f\">dot</span>(a, b) / (np.linalg.<span class=\"tok-f\">norm</span>(a) * np.linalg.<span class=\"tok-f\">norm</span>(b))\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">save</span>(self, path: str):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"序列化到文件\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> pickle\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">with</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">open</span>(path, <span class=\"tok-s\">'wb'</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">as</span> f:\\n            pickle.<span class=\"tok-f\">dump</span>({\\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'dim'</span>: self.dim,\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'nodes'</span>: self.nodes,\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'graphs'</span>: self.graphs,\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">'entry_point'</span>: self.entry_point,\n            }, f)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-t\">@classmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">load</span>(cls, path: str):\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"从文件反序列化\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> pickle\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">with</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">open</span>(path, <span class=\"tok-s\">'rb'</span>) <span class=\"tok-k\">as</span> f:\\n            data = pickle.<span class=\"tok-f\">load</span>(f)\\n        idx = <span class=\"tok-f\">cls</span>(data[<span class=\"tok-s\">'dim'</span>])\\n        idx.nodes = data[<span class=\"tok-s\">'nodes'</span>]\\n        idx.graphs = data[<span class=\"tok-s\">'graphs'</span>]\\n        idx.entry_point = data[<span class=\"tok-s\">'entry_point'</span>]\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> idx\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 使用示例</span>\nindex = <span class=\"tok-f\">HnswIndex</span>(dim=<span class=\"tok-n\">1536</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> vec <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> embeddings:\n    index.<span class=\"tok-f\">insert</span>(vec)\nresults = index.<span class=\"tok-f\">search</span>(query_vec, top_k=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>)\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># results = [(node_id, distance), ...]</span>\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 10万向量：线性扫描 ~200ms，HNSW ~2ms</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔥 面试视角：HNSW 的空间换时间</div><p>10 万向量线性扫描 O(n) = 10 万次距离计算 ≈ 200ms。<br>\n    HNSW O(log n) ≈ 17 次距离计算 ≈ 2ms。<strong>快了 100 倍</strong>。<br>\n    代价是构建图需要额外内存（每个节点存邻居指针），但搜索速度提升远超内存代价。<br><br>\n    <strong>面试要点</strong>：HNSW 是用空间换时间——构建图需要额外内存，但搜索从 O(n) 降到 O(log n)。</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.11 Token 预算管理：上下文超限怎么办</h2>\n<p>RAG 检索到 20 个相关 chunk，加上对话历史，拼进 Prompt 后超过了模型的上下文窗口——这是个非常常见的生产问题。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：Prompt 超长被拒</div><p>GPT-4o 上下文窗口 128K Token，GPT-3.5 只有 16K。如果检索结果 + 历史 + 问题总共 180K Token，API 直接报错 <code>context_length_exceeded</code>。<br><br>\n    更隐蔽的问题：即使没超限，超长 Prompt 也会导致<strong>注意力稀释</strong>——模型可能忽略中间位置的关键上下文（Lost in the Middle 问题）。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.11.1 Token 估算</h3>\n<p>不同字符的 Token 消耗不同，可以简单估算：</p>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>字符类型</th>\n        <th>估算规则</th>\n        <th>示例</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>ASCII（英文/代码）</td><td>~4 字符 / Token</td><td><code>function handle_messages</code> ≈ 6 tokens</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>CJK（中文/日文）</td><td>~2 字符 / Token</td><td><code>处理消息函数</code> ≈ 3 tokens</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>混合内容</td><td>取加权平均</td><td>中英混排 ≈ 3 字符 / Token</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.11.2 三级降级策略</h3>\n<p>核心原则：<code>context_limit = model_limit × 0.7</code>（留 30% 给 Response）。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">Level 0: 全量发送<br>estimated_tokens &lt; context_limit</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">超限</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">Level 1: 裁剪上下文<br>移除低分 chunk, 保留高分 chunk + 完整历史</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">仍超限</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">Level 2: 裁剪历史<br>只保留最近 2 条历史 + 高分 chunk</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">仍超限</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">Level 3: 紧急模式<br>无历史, 仅 top-3 chunk + 简化 prompt</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.11.3 代码实现：Token 估算 + 逐级降级</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-c\"># Token 估算：ASCII ~4字符/token，CJK ~2字符/token</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">estimate_tokens</span>(text: str) -&gt; int:\n    ascii_chars = <span class=\"tok-f\">sum</span>(<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> c <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> text <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">ord</span>(c) &lt; <span class=\"tok-n\">128</span>)\n    cjk_chars = <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(text) - ascii_chars\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> (ascii_chars <span class=\"tok-c\">// 4) + (cjk_chars // 2)</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 模型上下文窗口限制</span>\n<span class=\"tok-t\">MODEL_LIMITS</span> = {\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">128_000</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">128_000</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">16_000</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"claude-3.5-sonnet\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">200_000</span>,\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"deepseek-chat\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">64_000</span>,\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">get_model_context_limit</span>(model: str) -&gt; int:\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> key, limit <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-t\">MODEL_LIMITS</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">items</span>():\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> key <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> model.<span class=\"tok-f\">lower</span>():\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> limit\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-n\">16_000</span>  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 默认 16K</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 三级降级策略</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">build_prompt_with_fallback</span>(\n    results: list,          <span class=\"tok-c\"># 检索结果 [(score, content), ...]</span>\n    query: str,\n    history: list,          <span class=\"tok-c\"># 对话历史 [(role, content), ...]</span>\n    model: str,\n) -&gt; str:\n    model_limit = <span class=\"tok-f\">get_model_context_limit</span>(model)\n    context_limit = <span class=\"tok-f\">int</span>(model_limit * <span class=\"tok-n\">0.7</span>)  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 30% 留给 response</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 0: 全量发送</span>\n    context = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n---\\n\"</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>([r[<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>] <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> r <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> results])\n    prompt = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"## 知识库内容\\n{context}\\n\\n## 对话历史\\n\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> role, content <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> history:\n        prompt += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"{role}: {content}\\n\"</span>\n    prompt += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n## 问题\\n{query}\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">estimate_tokens</span>(prompt) &lt;= context_limit:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> prompt  <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 0: 直接返回</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 1: 裁剪上下文（移除低分 chunk）</span>\n    sorted_results = <span class=\"tok-f\">sorted</span>(results, key=<span class=\"tok-k\">lambda</span> x: x[<span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>], reverse=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>)\n    trimmed_context = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n---\\n\"</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>([r[<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>] <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> r <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> sorted_results[:<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>]])\n    prompt_l1 = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"## 知识库内容\\n{trimmed_context}\\n\\n## 对话历史\\n\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> role, content <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> history:\n        prompt_l1 += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"{role}: {content}\\n\"</span>\n    prompt_l1 += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n## 问题\\n{query}\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">estimate_tokens</span>(prompt_l1) &lt;= context_limit:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> prompt_l1  <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 1: 裁剪上下文</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 2: 裁剪历史（只保留最近 2 条）</span>\n    recent_history = history[-<span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>:] <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(history) &gt; <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">else</span> history\n    prompt_l2 = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"## 知识库内容\\n{trimmed_context}\\n\\n## 对话历史\\n\"</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> role, content <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> recent_history:\n        prompt_l2 += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"{role}: {content}\\n\"</span>\n    prompt_l2 += f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n## 问题\\n{query}\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">estimate_tokens</span>(prompt_l2) &lt;= context_limit:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> prompt_l2  <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 2: 裁剪历史</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># Level 3: 紧急模式（无历史，top-3 chunk，简化 prompt）</span>\n    top3 = <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\\n\"</span>.<span class=\"tok-f\">join</span>([r[<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>] <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> r <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> sorted_results[:<span class=\"tok-n\">3</span>]])\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"基于以下信息回答：\\n{top3}\\n\\n问题：{query}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 使用示例</span>\nprompt = <span class=\"tok-f\">build_prompt_with_fallback</span>(\n    results=[(<span class=\"tok-n\">0.95</span>, chunk1), (<span class=\"tok-n\">0.87</span>, chunk2), ...],\n    query=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"如何配置渠道重试\"</span>,\n    history=[(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"user\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"之前问的\"</span>), (<span class=\"tok-s\">\"assistant\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"之前答的\"</span>)],\n    model=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o\"</span>,\n)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-info\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📊 模型上下文窗口映射表</div><p><code>GPT-4o</code> = 128K &nbsp;|&nbsp; <code>Claude 3.5 Sonnet</code> = 200K &nbsp;|&nbsp; <code>GPT-3.5</code> = 16K &nbsp;|&nbsp; <code>DeepSeek</code> = 64K<br>\n    context_limit = model_limit × 0.7（30% 留给 Response）</p></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔥 面试视角：降级不是截断</div><p>降级策略的核心不是\"粗暴截断\"，而是<strong>优先级裁剪</strong>：<br>\n    ① 先裁低分 chunk（保高分的）→ ② 再裁老历史（保最近的）→ ③ 最后才紧急模式<br><br>\n    <strong>面试要点</strong>：降级不是\"截断\"，而是\"优先级裁剪\"——保高分 chunk、保最近历史。</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.12 从零构建 RAG：不依赖外部向量数据库</h2>\n<p>大多数 RAG 教程第一步就是 <code>pip install chromadb</code> 或注册 Pinecone。但生产中很多场景不想引入新依赖——桌面应用、私有部署、小团队工具。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：引入向量数据库的代价</div><ul class=\"mp-list\"><li><strong>部署复杂度</strong>：Milvus 需要 etcd + MinIO + S3，Qdrant 需要 Docker，Pinecone 需要云账号</li><li><strong>运维成本</strong>：多一个组件就多一个故障点、多一个监控指标</li><li><strong>桌面应用不现实</strong>：你不可能让用户装一个 Milvus 来运行你的桌面 App</li></ul></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.12.1 嵌入式方案：SQLite 三件套</h3>\n<p>WaLiAPI 的做法：<strong>SQLite 存数据 + BLOB 存向量 + 手写 HNSW + FTS5 全文索引</strong>，一个 <code>.db</code> 文件搞定。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">Embedding 渠道复用<br>复用 LLM 网关的渠道调度</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">一个 SQLite .db 文件</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">HNSW 索引文件 (.bin)<br>bincode 序列化, 内存映射加载</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_knowledge_bases<br>知识库元数据</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_documents<br>文档记录 + content_hash</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_chunks<br>分块 + BLOB 向量</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_tasks<br>异步处理任务</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_conversations<br>对话历史</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">kb_sources<br>来源导入记录</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process mp-flow-branch\">FTS5 虚拟表<br>SQLite 内置, BM25 排序</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.12.2 Embedding 渠道复用</h3>\n<p>如果你已经有一个 LLM API 网关（如 WaLiAPI），它已经有完善的渠道调度、重试、多渠道 fallback。<strong>为什么不直接复用？</strong></p>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔧 复用网关的 Embedding 调度</div><p><strong>不需要额外配置 API Key</strong>，直接复用用户已有的渠道设置：<br>\n    1. 获取启用的渠道列表 → 2. 选择支持 embedding 模型的渠道 → 3. 逐个尝试，失败自动 fallback<br><br>\n    这意味着：<strong>零额外 API Key、零额外配置、零额外服务</strong>。用户只要配好 LLM 渠道，知识库就能自动复用。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.12.3 对比：外部向量数据库 vs 嵌入式方案</h3>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>维度</th>\n        <th>外部向量数据库<br>(Milvus/Qdrant/Pinecone)</th>\n        <th>嵌入式方案<br>(SQLite + BLOB + HNSW + FTS5)</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>依赖</strong></td><td>独立服务 + Docker</td><td>零外部依赖，一个 .db 文件</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>部署</strong></td><td>需部署 Milvus/Qdrant 服务</td><td>无需额外部署</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>运维</strong></td><td>独立监控、备份、扩容</td><td>随主应用一起备份</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>适合规模</strong></td><td>百万-亿级向量</td><td>万-百万级向量</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>成本</strong></td><td>服务器/云费用</td><td>零额外成本</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>适合场景</strong></td><td>大规模企业检索</td><td>桌面应用、小团队、私有部署</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.12.4 代码实现：SQLite BLOB 存向量</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> sqlite3\n<span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> struct\n<span class=\"tok-k\">import</span> numpy <span class=\"tok-k\">as</span> np\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 将向量编码为 BLOB（二进制存储，比 JSON 省 75% 空间）</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">encode_embedding</span>(embedding: list[float]) -&gt; bytes:\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> struct.<span class=\"tok-f\">pack</span>(f<span class=\"tok-s\">'{len(embedding)}f'</span>, *embedding)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 从 BLOB 解码向量</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">decode_embedding</span>(blob: bytes, dim: int) -&gt; np.ndarray:\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> np.<span class=\"tok-f\">array</span>(struct.<span class=\"tok-f\">unpack</span>(f<span class=\"tok-s\">'{dim}f'</span>, blob), dtype=np.float32)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 存储向量到 SQLite</span>\nconn = sqlite3.<span class=\"tok-f\">connect</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"knowledge.db\"</span>)\ncur = conn.<span class=\"tok-f\">cursor</span>()\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 创建带 BLOB 向量列的表</span>\ncur.<span class=\"tok-f\">execute</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS kb_chunks (\n        id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n        content TEXT NOT NULL,\n        embedding BLOB,           -- 向量二进制存储\n        embedding_dim INTEGER,    -- 向量维度\n        metadata TEXT DEFAULT '{}'\n    )\n\"\"\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 插入一个 chunk（向量存为 BLOB）</span>\nembedding = [<span class=\"tok-n\">0.1</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0.2</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">0.3</span>, ...]  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 1536 维</span>\ncur.<span class=\"tok-f\">execute</span>(\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"INSERT INTO kb_chunks (id, content, embedding, embedding_dim) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\"</span>,\n    (<span class=\"tok-s\">\"chunk_001\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"函数内容...\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-f\">encode_embedding</span>(embedding), <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(embedding))\n)\nconn.<span class=\"tok-f\">commit</span>()\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 线性搜索（无索引时的 fallback）</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">vector_search</span>(query_embedding: list[float], top_k: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>) -&gt; list:\n    chunks = cur.<span class=\"tok-f\">execute</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"SELECT id, content, embedding, embedding_dim FROM kb_chunks\"</span>).<span class=\"tok-f\">fetchall</span>()\n    results = []\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> chunk_id, content, blob, dim <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> chunks:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> dim != <span class=\"tok-f\">len</span>(query_embedding):\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">continue</span>\n        emb = <span class=\"tok-f\">decode_embedding</span>(blob, dim)\n        score = np.<span class=\"tok-f\">dot</span>(query_embedding, emb) / (\n            np.linalg.<span class=\"tok-f\">norm</span>(query_embedding) * np.linalg.<span class=\"tok-f\">norm</span>(emb)\n        )\n        results.<span class=\"tok-f\">append</span>((chunk_id, content, <span class=\"tok-f\">float</span>(score)))\n    results.<span class=\"tok-f\">sort</span>(key=<span class=\"tok-k\">lambda</span> x: x[<span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>], reverse=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>)\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> results[:top_k]\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># FTS5 全文搜索</span>\ncur.<span class=\"tok-f\">execute</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"\n    CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE IF NOT EXISTS kb_chunks_fts \n    USING fts5(chunk_id, content, symbol_name)\n\"\"\"</span>)\n\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">fts5_search</span>(query: str, top_k: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>) -&gt; list:\n    results = cur.<span class=\"tok-f\">execute</span>(\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"SELECT chunk_id, content, bm25(kb_chunks_fts) as rank \"</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"FROM kb_chunks_fts WHERE kb_chunks_fts MATCH ? ORDER BY rank LIMIT ?\"</span>,\n        (query, top_k)\n    ).<span class=\"tok-f\">fetchall</span>()\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> results\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 混合检索：向量 0.7 + FTS5 0.3</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">hybrid_search</span>(query: str, query_embedding: list[float], top_k: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>) -&gt; list:\n    vec_results = {r[<span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>]: r[<span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>] * <span class=\"tok-n\">0.7</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> r <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">vector_search</span>(query_embedding, top_k * <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>)}\n    fts_results = {r[<span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>]: <span class=\"tok-f\">abs</span>(r[<span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>]) * <span class=\"tok-n\">0.3</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> r <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">fts5_search</span>(query, top_k * <span class=\"tok-n\">2</span>)}\n    merged = {}\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> chunk_id, score <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> vec_results.<span class=\"tok-f\">items</span>():\n        merged[chunk_id] = merged.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(chunk_id, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>) + score\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> chunk_id, score <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> fts_results.<span class=\"tok-f\">items</span>():\n        merged[chunk_id] = merged.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(chunk_id, <span class=\"tok-n\">0</span>) + score\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">sorted</span>(merged.<span class=\"tok-f\">items</span>(), key=<span class=\"tok-k\">lambda</span> x: x[<span class=\"tok-n\">1</span>], reverse=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>)[:top_k]</pre></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.13 MCP + RAG：让任何 AI Agent 使用你的知识库</h2>\n<p>知识库建好了，但问题来了：<strong>Claude Desktop 用不了、Cursor 用不了、Copilot 用不了</strong>——每个 AI 工具各自为战，知识库成了孤岛。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：知识库孤岛</div><p>你花了一周建好知识库，上传了所有项目文档，RAG 问答也跑通了。然后：<br>\n    • 用 Claude Desktop？连不上你的知识库。<br>\n    • 用 Cursor？得自己写插件。<br>\n    • 用 Copilot？没有知识库接口。<br>\n    • 自研 Agent？从头对接一遍。<br><br>\n    每个工具都要单独对接，<strong>N 个工具 = N 套对接代码</strong>。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.13.1 MCP 是什么？</h3>\n<p><strong>MCP（Model Context Protocol）</strong> 是 Anthropic 推出的开放协议，标准化 AI 模型与外部工具的交互方式。你可以理解为：<strong>USB-C 接口之于充电器，MCP 之于 AI 工具</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">知识库 (RAG)</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">MCP Server<br>JSON-RPC + SSE<br>13 个工具</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">Claude Desktop</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">Cursor</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">Copilot</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool mp-flow-branch\">自研 Agent</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.13.2 暴露 13 个 MCP 工具</h3>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>分类</th>\n        <th>工具名</th>\n        <th>说明</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>检索问答</strong></td><td><code>search</code></td><td>语义搜索知识库</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>ask</code></td><td>RAG 问答（检索 + 生成）</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>list_knowledge_bases</code></td><td>列出所有知识库</td></tr>\n      <tr><td rowspan=\"4\"><strong>文档管理</strong></td><td><code>read_document</code></td><td>读取文档内容</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>upload_document</code></td><td>上传文档</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>delete_document</code></td><td>删除文档</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>list_documents</code></td><td>列出知识库的文档</td></tr>\n      <tr><td rowspan=\"5\"><strong>知识库管理</strong></td><td><code>create_kb</code></td><td>创建知识库</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>update_kb</code></td><td>更新知识库配置</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>delete_kb</code></td><td>删除知识库</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>get_kb_stats</code></td><td>获取知识库统计</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><code>build_index</code></td><td>构建 HNSW 索引</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>来源导入</strong></td><td><code>import_source</code></td><td>从 Git/URL/本地目录导入</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.13.3 instructions 注入</h3>\n<p>Agent 首次连接 MCP Server 时，自动注入系统提示，引导 Agent 优先使用 <code>ask</code> / <code>search</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📝 instructions 示例</div><div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><pre class=\"code\">你已连接到知识库 <span class=\"tok-t\">MCP</span> 服务。\n\n**优先使用以下工具：**\n- ask: 直接提问，系统会自动检索+生成回答\n- search: 语义搜索知识库内容\n\n**反模式提醒：**\n- ❌ 不要用 read_document 读取整个文档再自己分析\n- ❌ 不要用 list_documents 遍历所有文档\n- ✅ 直接用 ask 提问，让系统检索最相关内容\n\n**支持的文件格式：** md, txt, pdf, docx, <span class=\"tok-f\">code</span> (rs/py/ts/js/go/java)</pre></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.13.4 代码实现：MCP 工具定义</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-c\"># MCP 工具定义（JSON-RPC 2.0 格式）</span>\n<span class=\"tok-t\">MCP_TOOLS</span> = [\n    {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"语义搜索知识库，返回最相关的文档片段\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"inputSchema\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"object\"</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"properties\"</span>: {\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"query\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"搜索查询\"</span>},\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"知识库 ID（可选，不填则搜索所有）\"</span>},\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"top_k\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"integer\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"default\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>},\n            },\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"required\"</span>: [<span class=\"tok-s\">\"query\"</span>],\n        },\n    },\n    {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"ask\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"基于知识库内容回答问题（RAG 问答）\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"inputSchema\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"object\"</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"properties\"</span>: {\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"question\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"问题\"</span>},\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>},\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"model\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"default\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o\"</span>},\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"history\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"array\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"items\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"object\"</span>}},\n            },\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"required\"</span>: [<span class=\"tok-s\">\"question\"</span>],\n        },\n    },\n    {\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"build_index\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"为知识库构建 HNSW 向量索引\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-s\">\"inputSchema\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"object\"</span>,\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"properties\"</span>: {\n                <span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>: {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"string\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"知识库 ID\"</span>},\n            },\n            <span class=\"tok-s\">\"required\"</span>: [<span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>],\n        },\n    },\n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># ... 共 13 个工具</span>\n]\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 处理 MCP 请求</span>\n<span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">handle_mcp_request</span>(method: str, params: dict) -&gt; dict:\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> method == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"tools/call\"</span>:\n        tool_name = params[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"name\"</span>]\n        arguments = params[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"arguments\"</span>]\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> tool_name == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"search\"</span>:\n            results = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> retriever.<span class=\"tok-f\">search_all</span>(\n                pool, <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">embed</span>([arguments[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"query\"</span>]]),\n                arguments.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"top_k\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>), mcp_only=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>\n            )\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"content\"</span>: [{<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>: json.<span class=\"tok-f\">dumps</span>(results)}]}\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-k\">elif</span> tool_name == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"ask\"</span>:\n            answer = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> rag.<span class=\"tok-f\">ask</span>(\n                pool, arguments.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"</span>),\n                arguments[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"question\"</span>],\n                embedding_model, arguments.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"model\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"gpt-4o\"</span>),\n                top_k=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>, mcp_only=<span class=\"tok-k\">True</span>,\n                history=arguments.<span class=\"tok-f\">get</span>(<span class=\"tok-s\">\"history\"</span>, []),\n            )\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"content\"</span>: [{<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>: answer.answer}]}\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-k\">elif</span> tool_name == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"build_index\"</span>:\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> retriever.<span class=\"tok-f\">build_index</span>(pool, arguments[<span class=\"tok-s\">\"kb_id\"</span>], progress_cb)\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"content\"</span>: [{<span class=\"tok-s\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-s\">\"text\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-s\">\"索引构建完成\"</span>}]}\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">elif</span> method == <span class=\"tok-s\">\"tools/list\"</span>:\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> {<span class=\"tok-s\">\"tools\"</span>: <span class=\"tok-t\">MCP_TOOLS</span>}</pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔥 面试视角：MCP 解决了什么问题？</div><p><strong>MCP 解决的是\"工具调用标准化\"问题</strong>。没有 MCP，每个 AI 工具都要单独对接知识库；有了 MCP，知识库只需要实现一次 MCP 协议，所有支持 MCP 的 Agent 都能直接使用。<br>\n    <strong>RAG + MCP = 知识库即服务</strong>——一个知识库，同时服务 Claude Desktop、Cursor、Copilot 和自研 Agent。</p></div>\n<h2 class=\"sh\">20.14 Deep Research：多轮迭代检索-分析-综合</h2>\n<p>Agentic RAG 解决了\"检索结果够不够\"的问题，但面对<strong>研究性问题</strong>——\"分析我们系统所有模块的技术选型和设计权衡\"——单轮检索+反思还是不够。</p>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-error\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">⚠️ 痛点：复杂研究性问题</div><p>用户问\"<code>分析我们系统所有模块的技术选型和设计权衡</code>\"，这需要：<br>\n    • 第 1 轮：检索架构概览<br>\n    • 第 2 轮：检索每个模块的技术选型<br>\n    • 第 3 轮：检索每个模块的设计权衡<br>\n    • 第 4 轮：检索已知问题和改进方向<br>\n    • 最后：综合所有发现，生成研究报告<br><br>\n    Agentic RAG 的反思循环最多 3 轮，且侧重\"信息够不够\"而非\"信息全不全\"。</p></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.14.1 Deep Research 流程</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-flow\"><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-start\">用户问题</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">第 1 轮检索<br>检索架构概览 / 模块列表</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">分析发现<br>识别 6 个模块, 每个需深入</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">生成追问<br>模块A技术选型? 模块B设计权衡?</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">追问</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">第 2 轮检索<br>检索模块详情 / 技术选型理由</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-process\">分析发现<br>3 个设计权衡, 改进方向未覆盖</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-decision\">生成追问<br>已知问题? 改进方向?</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">追问</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-tool\">第 N 轮检索</div><div class=\"mp-flow-link\"><span class=\"mp-flow-link-label\">信息充分</span><span class=\"mp-flow-link-arrow\">↓</span></div><div class=\"mp-flow-card mp-flow-end\">综合报告<br>技术选型 + 设计权衡 + 改进方向</div></div>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.14.2 Deep Research vs Agentic RAG</h3>\n<table class=\"mp-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>维度</th>\n        <th>Agentic RAG</th>\n        <th>Deep Research</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td><strong>核心循环</strong></td><td>检索 → 反思 → 再检索</td><td>检索 → 分析 → 追问 → 再检索 → 综合</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>侧重</strong></td><td>信息够不够</td><td>信息全不全</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>思维模式</strong></td><td>答题思维</td><td>调研思维</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>输出</strong></td><td>简短回答</td><td>综合报告</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>典型场景</strong></td><td>\"限流策略和降级策略分别是什么？\"</td><td>\"分析所有模块的技术选型和设计权衡\"</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><strong>迭代次数</strong></td><td>通常 ≤ 3 轮</td><td>通常 3-10 轮</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n<h3 class=\"sh\">20.14.3 代码实现：Deep Research 核心循环</h3>\n<div class=\"mp-codeblock\"><span class=\"mp-code-lang\">Python</span><pre class=\"code\"><span class=\"tok-k\">async</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">deep_research</span>(\n    question: str,\n    kb_id: str,\n    max_rounds: int = <span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>,\n) -&gt; str:\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"多轮迭代检索-分析-综合\"\"\"</span>\n    all_findings = []      <span class=\"tok-c\"># 所有发现</span>\n    all_sources = []       <span class=\"tok-c\"># 所有引用来源</span>\n    \n    current_query = question\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-k\">for</span> round_num <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">range</span>(max_rounds):\n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 1. 检索</span>\n        results = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">hybrid_search</span>(current_query, kb_id, top_k=<span class=\"tok-n\">10</span>)\n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">not</span> results:\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">break</span>\n        \n        all_sources.<span class=\"tok-f\">extend</span>(results)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 2. 分析：LLM 分析当前检索结果，提取发现 + 生成追问</span>\n        analysis_prompt = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"\n        原始问题：{question}\n        当前检索结果：{format_results(results)}\n        已有发现：{all_findings}\n        \n        请分析：\n        1. 从当前检索结果中提取了哪些新发现？\n        2. 还缺少什么信息？生成下一步检索查询。\n        3. 如果信息已充分，回复\"信息充分\"。\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        analysis = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> llm.<span class=\"tok-f\">invoke</span>(analysis_prompt)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-k\">if</span> <span class=\"tok-s\">\"信息充分\"</span> <span class=\"tok-k\">in</span> analysis:\n            <span class=\"tok-k\">break</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 3. 提取发现</span>\n        findings = <span class=\"tok-f\">extract_findings</span>(analysis)\n        all_findings.<span class=\"tok-f\">extend</span>(findings)\n        \n        <span class=\"tok-c\"># 4. 生成追问</span>\n        current_query = <span class=\"tok-f\">extract_next_query</span>(analysis)\n    \n    <span class=\"tok-c\"># 5. 综合报告</span>\n    synthesis_prompt = f<span class=\"tok-s\">\"\"\"\n    原始问题：{question}\n    所有发现：{all_findings}\n    所有来源：{all_sources}\n    \n    请综合以上信息，生成一份完整的研究报告。\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    report = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> llm.<span class=\"tok-f\">invoke</span>(synthesis_prompt)\n    <span class=\"tok-k\">return</span> report\n\n<span class=\"tok-c\"># 使用示例</span>\nreport = <span class=\"tok-k\">await</span> <span class=\"tok-f\">deep_research</span>(\n    <span class=\"tok-s\">\"分析 WaLiAPI 所有模块的技术选型和设计权衡\"</span>,\n    kb_id=<span class=\"tok-s\">\"waliapi-docs\"</span>,\n    max_rounds=<span class=\"tok-n\">5</span>,\n)\n<span class=\"tok-f\">print</span>(report)  <span class=\"tok-c\"># 输出综合研究报告</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card mp-accent-accent\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">🔥 面试视角：Deep Research vs Agentic RAG</div><p><strong>Agentic RAG</strong>是\"答题思维\"——检索→反思够不够→不够再搜→够了就答。<br>\n    <strong>Deep Research</strong>是\"调研思维\"——检索→分析发现了什么→追问还缺什么→再搜→最后综合成报告。<br><br>\n    核心区别：<strong>Agentic RAG 侧重\"信息够不够\"（宽度），Deep Research 侧重\"信息全不全\"（深度）</strong>。</p></div>\n<div class=\"mp-card\"><div class=\"mp-card-title\">📋 八股总结 — 面试高频考点</div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q1: RAG 的原理是什么？和微调有什么区别？</p><p><strong>RAG 原理</strong>：在生成回答前，先从外部知识库检索相关文档，将检索结果作为上下文喂给 LLM 生成回答。<br><br>\n      <strong>与微调的区别</strong>：RAG 是\"外挂知识库\"，不改模型参数，知识实时更新，成本低；微调是\"内化知识\"，修改模型参数，适合定制风格/格式，成本高。最佳实践是两者结合：微调改善输出风格，RAG 提供最新知识。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q2: 向量数据库和传统数据库有什么区别？</p><p>传统数据库做精确匹配（WHERE id=123），向量数据库做<strong>相似度搜索</strong>（找到最接近的 K 个向量）。向量数据库使用 ANN（近似最近邻）算法索引，如 HNSW、IVF，能在百万级向量中毫秒返回结果。主流方案：Chroma（原型）、Pinecone（云托管）、Milvus（大规模自部署）、pgvector（PostgreSQL 插件）。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q3: 什么是混合检索？为什么要做重排序？</p><p><strong>混合检索</strong>：BM25（关键词匹配）+ 向量检索（语义匹配）加权融合。BM25 擅长精确关键词（如\"GPT-4o\"），向量擅长语义（如\"大语言模型\"）。<br><br>\n      <strong>重排序</strong>：向量检索召回快但精度有限，用 Cross-Encoder 对候选集逐一精细打分。两阶段：先快召回 Top-50（毫秒级），再精排序 Top-5（百毫秒级），兼顾速度和精度。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q4: RAG 系统如何评估？</p><p>从两个阶段评估：<br>\n      <strong>检索质量</strong>：召回率（相关文档是否被检索到）、精确率（检索结果中有多少相关）、MRR（平均倒数排名）。<br>\n      <strong>生成质量</strong>：忠实度（回答是否基于检索内容，有没有幻觉）、相关性（回答是否切题）、完整性（是否覆盖了用户问题的所有方面）。可用 Ragas 框架自动化评估。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q5: 如何解决 RAG 检索不到相关文档的问题？</p><p>① <strong>Query 改写</strong>：用 LLM 改写用户问题，生成多个角度的查询并行检索；<br>\n      ② <strong>HyDE</strong>：先让 LLM 生成假回答，用假回答去检索（语义更丰富）；<br>\n      ③ <strong>调整分块策略</strong>：chunk_size 太大不精确，太小语义不完整，尝试 512-1024；<br>\n      ④ <strong>混合检索</strong>：加入 BM25 关键词检索，弥补向量检索关键词匹配弱的缺陷；<br>\n      ⑤ <strong>增加召回量</strong>：先召回 Top-20，再用 Reranker 精选 Top-5。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q6: RAG 检索出的内容相互冲突，Agent 该怎么取舍？</p><p>企业知识库文档版本多、来源杂，冲突是常态。三种策略：<br><br>\n      <strong>① 元数据加权排序</strong>：根据文档的发布时间、权威等级赋予不同权重，优先采信<strong>高权威 + 最新</strong>的内容。时间维度和权威维度双重保障。<br><br>\n      <strong>② 多智能体辩论（Multi-Agent Debate）</strong>：让不同 Agent 分别对应冲突的文档内容，相互对比论证，梳理出矛盾点，筛选出逻辑最通顺的答案。用\"辩论\"机制替代\"单点裁决\"。<br><br>\n      <strong>③ 强制溯源</strong>：要求 Agent 输出答案必须附带检索来源，方便用户最终校验核对。把最终裁决权交给人类。<br><br>\n      面试要点：不能只说\"取最新的\"，要展示元数据加权+多Agent辩论+溯源三重保障的组合思维。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q7: 企业 RAG 怎么解决权限隔离问题？会不会泄露涉密数据？</p><p>这是企业落地 RAG 的硬性安全要求，面试高频追问。我的解决方案是<strong>RAG权限对齐</strong>：<br><br>\n      <strong>存入阶段</strong>：在向量数据库存入数据时，给每一条向量绑定对应的访问控制权限元数据（如部门、角色、保密等级）。<br><br>\n      <strong>检索阶段</strong>：用户发起检索请求时，系统自动带入当前用户的身份权限做过滤。<br><br>\n      <strong>关键点</strong>：不是在\"结果返回后\"做过滤（可能已泄露敏感信息到上下文），而是<strong>在向量检索的源头就完成数据隔离</strong>。从根本上杜绝普通用户查到高管敏感数据的问题。<br><br>\n      面试要点：强调\"源头过滤\"而非\"事后过滤\"，体现对数据安全闭环的理解。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q8: 面对新闻/股价等实时更新知识库，RAG 怎么适配？</p><p>实时性是 RAG 落地的关键挑战。三种机制：<br><br>\n      <strong>① 动态路由 Agent</strong>：先判断用户问题是否需要实时数据。需要实时 → 优先调用搜索/实时 API，不检索静态向量库；不需要 → 正常走向量库检索。类似\"先思考再行动\"的智能分发。<br><br>\n      <strong>② 流式增量更新</strong>：通过消息队列监听知识库的实时变动，动态新增/更新向量数据，不用全量重构。增量更新效率高。<br><br>\n      <strong>③ 缓存失效机制</strong>：给高频问题设置缓存时效，元数据更新后立刻清空旧缓存，保存答案的时效性，避免返回过期信息。<br><br>\n      面试要点：三机制覆盖\"判断要不要实时\"（路由）、\"怎么更新\"（增量）、\"怎么保证不过期\"（缓存失效），体现全链路思维。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q9: 怎么系统提升 RAG 问答准确率？三层体系是什么？</p><p>这是最综合的一道题，需要展示\"从解析到检索到生成全链路\"的完整体系思维：<br><br>\n      <strong>第一层：深度解析层——解决文档拆分错乱</strong><br>\n      传统按字符切分会打断表格/标题/正文的关联。我用<strong>布局感知解析模型</strong>，把文档识别成标题、正文、表格、列表等完整模块，<strong>按标题层级切块</strong>，保证每一段内容语义完整不会断裂。核心思路：先理解文档结构，再按结构切。<br><br>\n      <strong>第二层：检索增强层——多阶段精准检索</strong><br>\n      ① <strong>向量检索 + BM25 关键词检索混合模式</strong>：兼顾语义匹配和专有名词匹配。单一向量检索会丢掉精确关键词匹配能力。<br>\n      ② <strong>重排序模型对初筛内容精排</strong>：这是提升准确率<strong>性价比最高</strong>的操作。初筛粗选 → 精排精选，二次提纯。<br>\n      ③ <strong>扩展 Query 生成多个同义问题并行检索</strong>：解决用户提问太简短、信息不全的问题。一个问题变成多个角度同时检索。<br><br>\n      <strong>第三层：生成校验层——实现自我纠错</strong><br>\n      答案生成前，Agent 做两次自检：<br>\n      <strong>第一检</strong>：判断检索内容是否足够回答问题 → 不足就重新检索。<br>\n      <strong>第二检</strong>：核对答案内容是否全部来自检索结果 → 杜绝无依据的幻觉输出。<br><br>\n      面试要点：三层体系覆盖解析（输入端）、检索（中间端）、生成（输出端），体现全链路精度提升而非单点优化。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q10: GraphRAG 和向量 RAG 的区别是什么？各自适合什么场景？</p><p><strong>核心区别在检索方式</strong>：向量 RAG 做语义相似度搜索，检索的是\"像\"的文本块；GraphRAG 从文档中抽取实体和关系构建知识图谱，检索时做图遍历，找到的是\"有关联\"的信息。<br><br>\n      <strong>向量 RAG 擅长</strong>：事实性问答（\"RAG 是什么？\"），单点查询，毫秒级响应，构建成本低。<br>\n      <strong>GraphRAG 擅长</strong>：多跳推理（\"A 公司 CEO 毕业于哪所大学？\"需要跨文档追溯），关系分析（\"这个故障影响哪些下游服务？\"），全局摘要，跨文档关联。<br><br>\n      <strong>GraphRAG 的代价</strong>：构建成本高（LLM 抽取实体关系消耗大量 Token），维护复杂（文档更新需同步更新图谱），有实体歧义问题（\"苹果\"是公司还是水果）。<br><br>\n      <strong>最佳实践</strong>：混合使用。向量 RAG 做日常问答（90% 场景），GraphRAG 做复杂关联分析（10% 场景）。面试要点是展示\"不是 GraphRAG 替代向量 RAG，而是互补\"的思维。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q11: Agentic RAG 什么时候触发检索？和传统 RAG pipeline 有什么本质区别？</p><p><strong>本质区别</strong>：传统 RAG 是固定流水线（Query → Retrieve → Generate），每次提问都检索且只检索一次；Agentic RAG 引入 Agent 做动态决策，具备三个传统 RAG 没有的能力：<br><br>\n      <strong>① 决策能力（是否检索）</strong>：Agent 判断问题类型——简单问题（\"你好\"、\"1+1\"）直接回答不检索，事实性问题才触发检索。触发信号包括：问题类型判断、知识边界检测（超出训练数据）、领域关键词匹配、用户显式要求。<br><br>\n      <strong>② 反思能力（够不够）</strong>：每轮检索后，Agent 评估已有文档是否足以完整回答问题。不足则指出缺什么，触发再检索。<br><br>\n      <strong>③ 迭代能力（换角度重搜）</strong>：根据反思结果改写 Query，换角度重新检索。比如第 1 轮搜\"限流策略\"，反思发现还缺\"降级策略\"，第 2 轮改搜\"降级策略\"。<br><br>\n      <strong>防止死循环</strong>：设最大检索次数（通常 3 轮），超过则用已有信息生成。面试要点：强调\"决策+反思+迭代\"三重能力，这是从\"工具\"升级为\"智能体\"的关键。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q12: 什么是 tree-sitter 符号感知分块？为什么代码 RAG 需要它？</p><p>传统按字符切分会截断函数/类，检索到的代码片段不完整——函数签名丢了、参数定义丢了，AI 根本看不懂。<br><br>\n      <strong>tree-sitter</strong> 构建 AST，按符号边界（函数/类/方法/结构体）切分，每个 chunk 带 <code>symbol_name</code>/<code>symbol_kind</code>/<code>line_start</code>/<code>line_end</code> 元数据。检索时可以按符号类型过滤：<strong>先 hybrid_search 再 filter_by_symbol(results, \"function\")</strong>，只返回函数定义，过滤掉注释和 import。<br><br>\n      支持 7 种语言：TS/TSX/JS/Python/Rust/Go/Java。面试要点：代码 RAG 和文本 RAG 的核心区别在于<strong>\"分块策略\"和\"检索过滤\"</strong>——不是按字符切，是按 AST 符号切；不是盲目返回，是按符号类型过滤。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q13: HNSW 索引的原理是什么？为什么不直接用线性扫描？</p><p><strong>HNSW（分层小世界图）</strong>：上层稀疏（高速公路），下层稠密（城市道路），搜索时从上层快速定位区域，再在下层精细搜索。使用贪心最佳优先搜索 + 优先级队列。<br><br>\n      <strong>性能对比</strong>：10 万向量线性扫描 O(n) = 10 万次距离计算 ≈ 200ms；HNSW O(log n) ≈ 17 次距离计算 ≈ 2ms。<strong>快了 100 倍</strong>。<br><br>\n      余弦距离 = 1 - cosine_similarity。纯手写 HNSW + bincode 序列化到本地文件，不依赖外部向量数据库。<br><br>\n      面试要点：HNSW 是<strong>用空间换时间</strong>——构建图需要额外内存（每个节点存邻居指针），但搜索从 O(n) 降到 O(log n)，代价远小于收益。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q14: RAG 系统中 Token 超限怎么办？降级策略怎么设计？</p><p><strong>Token 估算</strong>：ASCII ~4 字符/token，CJK ~2 字符/token。<code>context_limit = model_limit × 0.7</code>（30% 留给 Response）。<br><br>\n      <strong>三级降级</strong>：<br>\n      Level 1 裁低分 chunk（保留高分 + 完整历史）→ Level 2 裁历史只留最近 2 条（保留高分 chunk）→ Level 3 紧急模式（无历史，top-3 chunk，简化 prompt）。<br><br>\n      面试要点：降级不是\"截断\"，而是<strong>\"优先级裁剪\"</strong>——保高分 chunk（检索质量优先）、保最近历史（对话连贯性优先），不是简单砍掉尾部。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q15: 如何在不引入外部向量数据库的情况下实现 RAG？</p><p><strong>SQLite 三件套</strong>：SQLite 存数据 + BLOB 存向量（二进制序列化，比 JSON 省 75% 空间）+ 手写 HNSW 索引 + FTS5 全文索引。一个 <code>.db</code> 文件搞定存储 + 向量 + 全文检索，零外部依赖。<br><br>\n      <strong>Embedding 复用</strong>：如果已有 LLM API 网关，复用其渠道调度做向量化，零额外 API Key、零额外配置。<br><br>\n      适合中小规模知识库（万级 chunk），大规模仍需 Milvus/Qdrant。面试要点：不是\"用什么向量数据库\"，而是<strong>\"根据场景选择合适的方案\"</strong>——嵌入式方案适合桌面应用、小团队、私有部署。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q16: MCP 如何让 AI Agent 使用知识库？</p><p><strong>MCP（Model Context Protocol）</strong> 暴露 search/ask/build_index 等 13 个工具，任何 Agent 通过 JSON-RPC 调用。instructions 注入引导 Agent 优先用 ask/search，避免反模式（用 read_document 遍历整个文档）。<br><br>\n      <strong>一个知识库同时服务 Claude Desktop、Cursor、Copilot 和自研 Agent</strong>——不需要为每个工具单独对接。<br><br>\n      面试要点：MCP 解决的是<strong>\"工具调用标准化\"问题</strong>，就像 USB-C 之于充电器。RAG + MCP = <strong>知识库即服务</strong>。</p></div><div class=\"mp-card mp-qa\"><p class=\"mp-qa-q\">Q17: Deep Research 和 Agentic RAG 有什么区别？</p><p><strong>Agentic RAG</strong>：检索 → 反思 → 再检索，侧重\"信息够不够\"，输出简短回答，通常 ≤ 3 轮。是<strong>\"答题思维\"</strong>。<br><br>\n      <strong>Deep Research</strong>：检索 → 分析 → 追问 → 再检索 → 综合，侧重\"信息全不全\"，输出综合报告，通常 3-10 轮。是<strong>\"调研思维\"</strong>。<br><br>\n      典型场景对比：\"限流策略和降级策略分别是什么？\"用 Agentic RAG；\"分析所有模块的技术选型和设计权衡\"用 Deep Research。<br><br>\n      面试要点：Agentic RAG 侧重<strong>宽度</strong>（够不够），Deep Research 侧重<strong>深度</strong>（全不全）。不是替代关系，是互补关系。</p></div></div>"};
